#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:50
msgid "``valkey_enable_ttl``"
msgstr "``valkey_enable_ttl``"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:52
msgid ""
"Feature flag. When ``true``, every key is written with an expiry (see "
"``valkey_ttl_sec``) so Valkey/Redis ``volatile-*`` eviction policies can "
"reclaim L2 cache keys once the node reaches ``maxmemory``. When ``false``"
" (default), keys are persisted without a TTL."
msgstr "特性标志。当为 ``true`` 时，每个键都带有过期时间（参见 ``valkey_ttl_sec``），因此 Valkey/Redis 的 ``volatile-*`` 逐出策略可以在节点达到 ``maxmemory`` 时回收 L2 缓存键。当为 ``false``（默认值）时，键会被持久化而不带 TTL。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:53
msgid "``valkey_ttl_sec``"
msgstr "``valkey_ttl_sec``"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:54
msgid "``86400``"
msgstr "``86400``"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:55
msgid ""
"Key TTL in seconds, applied only when ``valkey_enable_ttl`` is ``true``. "
"Must be a positive integer. If the flag is enabled but this key is "
"omitted, it defaults to ``86400`` (24 hours)."
msgstr "键的 TTL（生存时间），仅在 ``valkey_enable_ttl`` 为 ``true`` 时应用。必须是正整数。如果启用该标志但未提供此键，则默认为 ``86400``（24 小时）。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:56
msgid "``request_timeout``"
msgstr "``request_timeout``"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:57
msgid "``5.0``"
msgstr "``5.0``"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:58
msgid ""
"GLIDE request timeout in seconds. Also used as the Python-side Future "
"timeout."
msgstr "GLIDE 请求超时时间（以秒为单位）。也用于 Python 端的 Future 超时。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:59
msgid "``connection_timeout``"
msgstr "``connection_timeout``"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:60
msgid "``10.0``"
msgstr "``10.0``"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:61
msgid "GLIDE connection timeout in seconds for initial client connections."
msgstr "初始客户端连接的 GLIDE 连接超时时间（以秒为单位）。"

