#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/valkey.rst:97
msgid ""
"Enable a per-key TTL so a node configured with a ``volatile-lru`` / "
"``volatile-lfu`` eviction policy can reclaim L2 cache keys once it "
"reaches ``maxmemory``. Without a TTL such policies never evict the KV "
"cache keys, which can choke the remote cache."
msgstr "启用每个键的 TTL，以便配置为 ``volatile-lru`` / ``volatile-lfu`` 逐出策略的节点在达到 ``maxmemory`` 后可以回收 L2 缓存键。如果没有 TTL，这些策略将永远不会逐出 KV 缓存键，这可能会导致远程缓存阻塞。"

